          "en": "of elements, we would need to write it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 162.75,
          "end": 165.9,
          "en": "So also there there are minor differences here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 167.37,
          "end": 171.9,
          "en": "But again, it just shows my rule of thumb that I told you earlier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 171.9,
          "end": 178.29,
          "en": "Whenever we go into the direction of scripts or variables at that point, or that's the point when I",
